       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. D12.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-SRC PIC X(10) VALUE "HELLOWORLD".
       01 WS-TARGET PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
       01 WS-COUNT PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
       01 WS-PIECE PIC X(5) VALUE SPACES.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           STRING WS-SRC(1:5) DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  WS-SRC(6:5) DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  INTO WS-TARGET.
           DISPLAY "TARGET=" WS-TARGET.
           UNSTRING WS-SRC DELIMITED BY "O"
               INTO WS-PIECE WS-TARGET(1:5).
           DISPLAY "PIECE=" WS-PIECE " TARGET=" WS-TARGET.
           INSPECT WS-SRC(3:4) TALLYING WS-COUNT FOR ALL "L".
           DISPLAY "COUNT=" WS-COUNT.
           STOP RUN.
